WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:00.953
- This is so cool.

00:00:00.953 --> 00:00:01.800
I love Michelle Obama,

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.120
and she recently posted about you

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.880
saying that you are one
of her favorite comedians.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:06.750
So how did that feel?

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:07.920
That's pretty rad.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:08.790
Just to have fans in general,

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:10.470
but somebody like her
to notice, that's cool.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:11.520
- It felt amazing.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.520
She had actually reached out to me

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.830
a couple years ago and sent me a letter,

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:17.910
like a handwritten letter,

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.500
and it's framed in my house

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.400
where she wrote me about
how touched she was

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.770
that I talk about women's bodies

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.000
and what happens to our bodies

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.770
and make us laugh at the same time.

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.780
And she was like, "I think
that's really important."

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:31.896
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:31.896 --> 00:00:33.180
- And so, yeah, of course.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:34.572
I mean, it's her.
- That's cool.

00:00:34.572 --> 00:00:35.405
Yeah.

00:00:35.405 --> 00:00:36.780
So it means the world to me.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:37.613
- Yeah.

00:00:37.613 --> 00:00:39.540
- And I have not yet to meet her.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.790
She was before COVID, she was set to come

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.890
to one of my shows in DC

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:46.320
and I think she bought like 25 seats.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:50.220
I'm sure half of them
were for Secret Service,

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.050
but whatever.
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.360
They paid for the tickets,
so I appreciate it.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.193
- [Kelly] Regardless, yeah.

00:00:55.193 --> 00:00:56.026
- Yeah.

00:00:56.026 --> 00:00:59.850
And so I'm really, I hope
she comes this summer.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:02.763
- Oh my gosh, you're so funny I cannot.

